  "name": "Parliamentary Works Estimates Commission",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Parliamentary Works Estimates Commission is established under the Parliamentary Buildings (Restoration and Renewal) Act 2019. Pursuant to the Act, as amended by the Parliamentary Works Sponsor Body (Abolition) Regulations 2022, the Estimates Commission examines and lays before the House of Commons the Parliamentary Works Grant Estimates.</p>",
